OL,5,G0000 The Warhol Effect
OL,6,     FFilm lifting the lid on the
OL,7,     Ffascinating last decade of Andy
OL,8,     FWarhol's life and the legacy he
OL,9,     Fleft for future artists, through
OL,10,     Fnever-before-seen footage and
OL,11,     Finterviews with insiders.
OL,12,G0200 Jacqueline Du Pre: Genius And
OL,13,G     Tragedy
OL,14,     FNarrated by Yo-Yo Ma, this film
OL,15,     Fcelebrates the enigmatic British
OL,16,     Fcellist, whose career was cruelly
OL,17,     Fcurtailed by multiple sclerosis
OL,18,     Fwhen she was twenty-eight years
OL,19,     Fold.
